## Quick Start

### Run Locally

```bash
# Install dependencies
pip install -r requirements.txt

# Start the server
uvicorn main:app --host {{ host }} --port {{ port }}
```

### Run with Docker

```bash
# Build the image
docker build -t {{ project_name }} .

# Run the container
docker run -p {{ port }}:{{ port }} {{ project_name }}
```

### Run with Docker Compose

```bash
docker-compose up -d
```

